-2\"><div class=\"menu-photo\"><img src=\"assets/vorspeisen-1280.webp\" srcSet=\"assets/vorspeisen-640.webp 640w, assets/vorspeisen-960.webp 960w, assets/vorspeisen-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 40px), 40vw\" alt=\"Vorspeisen\" width=\"800\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/><div class=\"menu-photo-caption\"><span>MỘC 83</span><p>Vorspeisen</p></div></div><div class=\"dish-list\"><article class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-heading\"><h3>Gỏi Cuốn</h3><span class=\"price\"><small>ab<!-- --> </small>5,50<!-- --> €</span></div><p>Sommerrollen mit Salat, Gurke, Reisnudeln, Sesam und Erdnüssen. Dazu Hoisin-Sauce.</p><small class=\"dish-detail\">2 Stück</small></article><article class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-heading\"><h3>Nem Hà Nội</h3><span class=\"price\">6,00<!-- --> €</span></div><p>Knusprige Frühlingsrollen mit Hackfleisch, Garnelen, Gemüse, Glasnudeln und Ei.</p><small class=\"dish-detail\">2 Stück</small></article><article class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-heading\"><h3>Gyoza</h3><span class=\"price\"><small>ab<!-- --> </small>5,00<!-- --> €</span></div><p>Knusprig gebratene japanische Teigtaschen mit Gemüse oder Hähnchen.</p><small class=\"dish-detail\">5 Stück</small></article><article class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-heading\"><h3>Nộm Xoài</h3><span class=\"price\"><small>ab<!-- --> </small>6,00<!-- --> €</span></div><p>Frische Mango, Gurke, Möhren und Minze mit Erdnüssen und hausgemachtem Dressing.</p><small class=\"dish-detail\">Mit Tofu, Hähnchen oder Garnelen</small></article><button class=\"underlined-link\">Vollständige Karte ansehen<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z\"></path></svg></button></div></div>","<div class=\"menu-layout\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"dish-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-3\"><div class=\"m