7px) calc(100vw - 40px), 40vw\" alt=\"Vietnamese kitchen\" width=\"800\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/><div class=\"menu-photo-caption\"><span>MỘC 83</span><p>Vietnamese kitchen</p></div></div><div class=\"dish-list\"><article class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-heading\"><h3>Phở Hà Nội</h3><span class=\"price\"><small>from<!-- --> </small>13,90<!-- --> €</span></div><p>Traditional rice noodle soup with bean sprouts, coriander and spring onions.</p><small class=\"dish-detail\">With tofu, chicken or beef</small></article><article class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-heading\"><h3>Bún Nam Bộ</h3><span class=\"price\"><small>from<!-- --> </small>13,90<!-- --> €</span></div><p>Rice noodles, salad and peanuts with homemade lime dressing.</p><small class=\"dish-detail\">Fresh, aromatic, Vietnamese</small></article><article class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-heading\"><h3>Curry Đỏ</h3><span class=\"price\"><small>from<!-- --> </small>13,90<!-- --> €</span></div><p>Red curry with coconut milk, sweet potato and seasonal vegetables. Served with rice.</p><small class=\"dish-detail\">With your choice of protein</small></article><article class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-heading\"><h3>Udon Xào</h3><span class=\"price\"><small>from<!-- --> </small>13,90<!-- --> €</span></div><p>Stir-fried udon noodles with seasonal vegetables, sesame and savoury udon sauce.</p><small class=\"dish-detail\">From the wok</small></article><button class=\"underlined-link\">View the full menu<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z\"></path></svg></button></div></div>","<div class=\"menu-layout\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"dish-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-1\"><div class=\"menu-photo\"><img src=\"assets/sushi.webp\" srcSet=\"assets/sushi-480.webp 480w, assets/sushi-960.webp 960w, assets/sushi-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 40px), 40vw\" alt=\"Sushi &amp; sashimi\" width=\"800\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/><div class=\"menu-photo-caption\"><span>MỘC 83</span><p>Sushi &amp; sashimi</p></div></div><div class=\"dish-list\"><article class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-heading\"><h3>Sake Avocado Maki</h3><span class=\"price\">5,50<!-- --> €</span></div><p>Salmon and avocado wrapped in sushi rice and nori.</p><small class=\"dish-detail\">6 pieces</small></article><article class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-heading\"><h3>Spezial Sake</h3><span class=\"price\">10,90<!-- --> €</span></div><p>Salmon, avocado, cream cheese and sesame, topped with seared salmon and special sauce.</p><small class=\"dish-detail\">4 pieces</small></article><article class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-heading\"><h3>Mộc 83 Sashimi</h3><span class=\"price\">15,90<!-- --> €</span></div><p>A selection of three slices of salmon and three slices of tuna.</p><small class=\"dish-detail\">6 slices</small></article><article class=\"dish\"><div class=\"dish-heading\"><h3>Sushi Menü 6</h3><span class=\"price\">49,00<!-- --> €</span></div><p>Inside-out rolls, maki, nigiri and sashimi to share. Served with two miso soups.</p><small class=\"dish-detail\">For 2 people</small></article><button class=\"underlined-link\">View the full menu<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z\"></path></svg></button></div></div>","<div class=\"menu-layout\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"dish-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-2\"><div class=\"menu-photo\"><img src=\"assets/vorspeisen-1280.webp\" srcSet=\"assets/vorspeisen-640.webp 640w, assets/vorspeisen-960.webp 960w, assets/vorspeisen-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 40px), 40vw\" alt=\"Starters\" width=\"800\" heigh